        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Harrison Newey, Mick Schumacher, Michael Schumacher, Corinna Schumacher, Ralf Schumacher, Sebastian Stahl\n- Organizations: Van Amersfoort Racing\n- Events: ADAC Formula 4 debut\n- Roles: Formula One World Champion, racing driver\n\nFacts:\n- In 2015, Harrison Newey made his ADAC Formula 4 debut with Van Amersfoort Racing.\n- In 2015, Harrison Newey partnered with Mick Schumacher at Van Amersfoort Racing.\n- Mick Schumacher is the son of Corinna Schumacher and Michael Schumacher.\n- Michael Schumacher is a seven-time Formula One World Champion.\n- Mick Schumacher is the nephew of former Formula One driver Ralf Schumacher.\n- Mick Schumacher is the stepnephew of Sebastian Stahl.",
